    "A longer paragraph continues in the next post (1/2, 2/2), cut between sentences. Auto picks, for each book, the smallest limit that fits 95% of its paragraphs in one post (at least 40 words). Focus mode shows only the text of each post. Post text size is in points: type a number or use − and +, in steps of 0.5. Lines are a third taller than the text, as on x.com. The accessibility text sizes in iOS Settings still make posts larger." : {},
